<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 00:47:32 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>西班牙和意大利开始互相检查护照，南欧的反移民态度显露出来</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/spain-supreme-court-ruling-ceuta-migrant-loophole/</link><description>意大利总理乔治亚·梅洛尼的办公室周五表示，意大利当局“无意”取消对来自西班牙的入境人员的边境检查。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2286397937-e1786205211576.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 16:07:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/spain-supreme-court-ruling-ceuta-migrant-loophole/</guid></item><item><title>梅赛德斯 AMG 汽车的司机提起集体诉讼，声称前座标志太热，以至于在字面上烙印了他们并导致烧伤</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/mercedes-amg-cars-class-action-lawsuit-front-seat-logo-burns/</link><description>诉讼称，某些梅赛德斯 AMG 车辆存在设计缺陷，凸起的金属 AMG 标志“合理地预计会接触乘员的上背部、颈部或肩膀”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26220673207862-e1786231171692.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 23:27:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/mercedes-amg-cars-class-action-lawsuit-front-seat-logo-burns/</guid></item><item><title>随着婴儿潮一代仅将一小部分财富转移给千禧一代和 X 一代，“财富大转移”将带来巨大的失望</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/great-wealth-transfer-baby-boomers-millennials-gen-x-heir-inheritance/</link><description>对于年轻一代来说，好消息是婴儿潮一代已经将一部分钱花在了他们的继承人身上。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1372028067-e1786224881243.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 23:01:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/great-wealth-transfer-baby-boomers-millennials-gen-x-heir-inheritance/</guid></item><item><title>伊朗提出了美国在重新开放霍尔木兹海峡之前必须满足的一长串严格要求，其中包括对战争损害的全额赔偿</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/iran-demands-strait-of-hormuz-us-conditions-total-compensation-war-damage/</link><description>最高国家安全委员会表示，在美国“纠正其行为”之前，霍尔木兹海峡不会开放。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2288486958-e1786222225153.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 20:58:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/iran-demands-strait-of-hormuz-us-conditions-total-compensation-war-damage/</guid></item><item><title>伊朗官员担心美国的封锁将导致经济崩溃，并承认迫切需要放松制裁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/iran-economic-collapse-us-naval-blockade-hormuz-sanctions-relief/</link><description>但伊朗的咄咄逼人的要求降低了人们对海峡交通很快恢复正常或美国将停止对伊朗施加经济压力的希望。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/9857553-e1786213668995.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 20:14:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/iran-economic-collapse-us-naval-blockade-hormuz-sanctions-relief/</guid></item><item><title>雪佛龙如何成为大型石油公司的人工智能宠儿</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/how-chevron-became-the-ai-darling-of-big-oil/</link><description>雪佛龙与微软的西德克萨斯数据中心合作可能会引发新的大数据和人工智能趋势。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/250318_Chevron_GEplant-00517_Edited.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 07:11:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/how-chevron-became-the-ai-darling-of-big-oil/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能改变工作的速度快于数据跟上的速度</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/ai-is-changing-work-faster-than-the-data-can-keep-up/</link><description>最近的研究表明人工智能对就业增长具有积极影响，但经济学家和劳工活动人士警告说，新兴技术可能会迅速改变金融体系。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-2259634870-e1785269298238.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/ai-is-changing-work-faster-than-the-data-can-keep-up/</guid></item><item><title>在两党的广泛支持下，国会即将授予特朗普“不受限制的权力”，对主要贸易伙伴征收高达 100% 的新关税</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/trump-tariffs-100-percent-russia-sanctions-bill-congress-import-taxes/</link><description>“我们不应该在制止普京的侵略和制止这位总统的关税制度之间做出选择。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289079238-e1786203868585.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 17:23:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/trump-tariffs-100-percent-russia-sanctions-bill-congress-import-taxes/</guid></item><item><title>认识一位 43 岁的女性，她接受了子宫切除术，并因医院实验室混淆而认为自己患有癌症</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/kaiser-permanente-cancer-misdiagnosis-delay-lawsuit/</link><description>“她来到凯撒医疗机构寻求答案，但离开时却得到了不属于她的诊断结果。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26218756135581-e1786206234148.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 16:24:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/kaiser-permanente-cancer-misdiagnosis-delay-lawsuit/</guid></item><item><title>20% 的美国人已经使用人工智能提供财务建议 - 另外 70% 的人不信任它</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/financial-advisers-trust-ai-usage-gap-gallup/</link><description>盖洛普民意调查发现，美国人信任的财务建议资源与他们实际依赖的资源之间存在脱节。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1434956815-e1786206012278.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 16:20:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/financial-advisers-trust-ai-usage-gap-gallup/</guid></item></channel></rss>